243 |     async def aload(self, filename: str, file_content_type: str, file_path: str) -> list[Document]:
244 |         """
245 |         Async wrapper around `load`.
246 | 
247 |         Document loaders dispatched by `_get_loader` (PyMuPDF, Unstructured,
